  "title": "Daria's Slow Cooker Beef Stroganoff",
  "description": "Long, slow cooking (7 to 8 hours) renders top round steak tender enough to use in place of the cuts that are normally required for Beef Stroganoff.",
  "authors": [
    "DARIA K"
  ],
